   "title": "Dialogue",
   "html": "<p class=\"muted\">Clara se perd en ville.</p><div class=\"dialogue\"><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຂໍໂທດ ທະນາຄານຢູ່ໃສ?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">X</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ກົງໄປ ແລ້ວລ້ຽວຊ້າຍ</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ໄກບໍ?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">X</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ບໍ່ໄກ ຍ່າງຫ້ານາທີ</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຢູ່ຂ້າງຕະຫຼາດບໍ?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">X</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ແມ່ນແລ້ວ ຢູ່ຕໍ່ໜ້າຕະຫຼາດ</span></div></div></div><details><summary>Romanisation (mots nouveaux)</summary><p><span class=\"rom\">Khɔ̌ɔ-thôot, thā-náa-kháan yùu sǎy?</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Kóng-pǎy, lɛ̏ɛw lȉaw sȁay.</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Kǎy bɔ̌ɔ?</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Bɔ̀ɔ kǎy. Nyāang hâa náa-thíi.</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Yùu khâang tá-lȁat bɔ̌ɔ?</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Mɛ̄ɛn lɛ̏ɛw. Yùu tɔ̀ɔ-nâa tá-lȁat.</span></p></details><details><summary>Traduction (seulement après avoir cherché)</summary><p><b>Clara</b> — Pardon, où est la banque ?<br><b>X</b> — Tout droit, puis à gauche.<br><b>Clara</b> — C&#x27;est loin ?<br><b>X</b> — Non. Cinq minutes à pied.<br><b>Clara</b> — C&#x27;est à côté du marché ?<br><b>X</b> — Oui. En face du marché.</p></details>"
